==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 39.33~40 seconds<sup>1,180f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 39.33~40 seconds<sup>1,180f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 39.33~40 seconds<sup>1,180f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)|Sanosuke Sagara]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

